{% comment %}
  Optional cart callout — mirrors Demo flow: cart → checkout → tip/sponsor page.
  Does NOT create Shopify orders or payments. Safe for demos / open-source sponsorship.
  Params:
    tip_url   — absolute or root-relative URL (theme setting or hard-coded sponsor page)
    tip_label — button label (default: 支持开源 / 请我喝杯咖啡)
  Usage:
    {% render 'cart-tip-note', tip_url: settings.tip_page_url %}
    {% render 'cart-tip-note', tip_url: 'https://example.com/tip', tip_label: '请我喝杯咖啡' %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign tip_href = tip_url | default: ''
  assign tip_text = tip_label | default: '请我喝杯咖啡'
-%}
{%- if tip_href != blank -%}
  <aside class="tf-cart-tip" data-geo="cart-tip-note" role="note">
    <p class="tf-cart-tip__body">
      本店演示结账仅作商品挑选与流程说明；若您认可开源 SEO/GEO 模板，可通过赞助页支持作者（非商品支付）。
    </p>
    <p class="tf-cart-tip__actions">
      <a class="tf-cart-tip__link" href="{{ tip_href | escape }}" rel="noopener">
        ☕ {{ tip_text | escape }}
      </a>
    </p>
  </aside>
{%- else -%}
  <aside class="tf-cart-tip tf-cart-tip--muted" data-geo="cart-tip-note" role="note">
    <p class="tf-cart-tip__body">
      结账为店铺正式订单流程。若主题配置了赞助页 URL（<code>tip_page_url</code>），此处会显示「请我喝杯咖啡」入口。
    </p>
  </aside>
{%- endif -%}
